  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Comments: This scene demonstrates a standard render setup with an optional overlay
    camera for rendering an extra layer which can include text, or even other game
    objects. This example also shows how to use property mappings to display the
    current time, timecode, and frame numbers rendered into the final image.
